#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:1
msgid "E4237"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `lexscan_target_impl_conditional`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`lexscan_target_impl_conditional`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:5
msgid ""
"The target has a scanning trait implementation, but that implementation "
"is not eligible for `lexscan`. It must apply to every instance of the "
"target type, without bounds on its type parameters, or be a non-generic "
"implementation for the exact, fully known target type."
msgstr "目标具有扫描 trait 实现，但该实现不满足 `lexscan` 的要求。它必须在没有类型参数约束的情况下适用于目标类型的所有实例，或是适用于已完全确定的目标确切类型的非泛型实现。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:10
msgid ""
"An implementation with a type parameter bound is rejected even when the "
"target satisfies that bound. Partially specialized implementations, such "
"as one for `Scanner[Array[T]]`, are also rejected."
msgstr "带类型参数约束的实现即使目标满足约束也会被拒绝。部分特化的实现（例如针对 `Scanner[Array[T]]` 的实现）同样会被拒绝。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:14
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:16
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(all) struct Scanner[T] {\n"
"  input : StringView\n"
"  mut cursor : Int32\n"
"  tag : T\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"impl[T : Show] @lexbuf.Scannable for Scanner[T] with fn scan_input(self) "
"{\n"
"  self.input\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"impl[T : Show] @lexbuf.Scannable for Scanner[T] with fn scan_cursor(self)"
" {\n"
"  self.cursor\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"impl[T : Show] @lexbuf.Scannable for Scanner[T] with fn "
"set_scan_cursor(self, cursor) {\n"
"  self.cursor = cursor\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn scan_word(target : Scanner[Int32]) -> Bool {\n"
"  lexscan target {\n"
"    re\"^[a-z]+\" => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:20
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:22
msgid ""
"Remove unnecessary bounds from the implementation, as below. If the "
"bounds are needed, use a wrapper with an eligible implementation instead."
" If an exact non-generic implementation exists, annotate the target so "
"its type is fully known."
msgstr "如下例所示，移除实现中不必要的约束。如果约束确有必要，应改用具有合适实现的包装类型。如果已有适用于确切类型的非泛型实现，为目标添加注解以使其类型完全确定。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4237.md:27
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(all) struct Scanner[T] {\n"
"  input : StringView\n"
"  mut cursor : Int32\n"
"  tag : T\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"impl[T] @lexbuf.Scannable for Scanner[T] with fn scan_input(self) {\n"
"  self.input\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"impl[T] @lexbuf.Scannable for Scanner[T] with fn scan_cursor(self) {\n"
"  self.cursor\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"impl[T] @lexbuf.Scannable for Scanner[T] with fn set_scan_cursor(self, "
"cursor) {\n"
"  self.cursor = cursor\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn scan_word(target : Scanner[Int32]) -> Bool {\n"
"  lexscan target {\n"
"    re\"^[a-z]+\" => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
